@osuki-dev/ui 2.0.0-beta.0: three places where beta.0 draws differently from
1.x, kept at the 1.x look until the kit ships the same (beta.1 changesets).

- Text (Android): the trailing slack sat inside the fontVariationSettings run,
  so its advance followed the requested weight and centred labels in a
  variable reader face moved by a point. It is appended after the run, at the
  paragraph's face, as the app's own Text did.
- Button: the root became a row in 2.0. Inside a wrapping column (the theme
  preview's export actions) a row root measured its label row against the
  parent and the buttons grew to twice their width with off-centre labels.
  The root is a column again, as in 1.x.
- Button.Background lifts every non-transparent variant in light mode, so a
  ghost given a protective base (components.Button.ghost.background while a
  pack is worn) gained the pill shadow it never had. A ghost stays flat.

Remove each hunk when the kit releases the matching fix.

